  "result": "Quiz 0002 is ready, and so is its key. The quiz is `quizzes/0002.json` and the key is `keys/0002.json`.\n\n- **Topic:** objective O4, telling workflows from agents by who owns the control flow, and when a fixed workflow is the better choice.\n- **Items:** six in all, five multiple choice and one short answer.\n- **Cases:** every item uses the makerspace assistant.\n- **Coverage:**\n  - the core difference\n  - classifying two designs, one of which has a model make a decision inside a code-controlled flow\n  - choosing a workflow for the booking steps\n  - why a workflow costs less per request\n  - which request most needs an agent\n- **Sources:** I wrote the quiz from the standard definitions of workflow and agent, and I did not search the web for a source. There is no lesson on O4 yet, so the quiz is ahead of the lessons. I can write that lesson next.\n- **Misconceptions:** the key links no distractors to misconception ids. The workspace's existing ids don't cover the wrong ideas these options encode, and I didn't want to invent ids. Say so if you'd like new ones added.\n\nDo you want a lesson on O4 before Riley takes this quiz?",
